            crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Elementary books for teaching children to read. [Source: Getty AAT] | a printed prayer book for the use of the laity (OED s.v. primer n.1 1, 2a), here small | a printed prayer book for the use of the laity (OED s.v. primer n.1 1, 2a), here written (printed?) on parchment and bound in velvet | an elementary school-book for teaching children to read (OED s.v. primer n.^1 2a) | a printed prayer book for the use of the laity (OED s.v. primer n.1 1, 2a) | an elementary school-book for teaching children to read, less likely a printed prayer book for the use of the laity for understanding the (Latin) mass (OED s.v. primer n.1 1, 2a) | either a printed prayer book for the use of the laity or an elementary school-book for teaching children to read (OED s.v. primer n.1 1, 2a) | probably a prayer book rather than an elementary school-book (since only one was imported) | either a printed prayer book for the use of the laity (to follow the Latin mass) or an elementary school-book for teaching children to read (OED s.v. primer n.1 1, 2a) | an elementary school-book for teaching children to read (OED s.v. primer n.1 1, 2a)" ;
